Yoob SDK for the Web
Copyright 2026 Tap Mobile

This product includes software developed at Tap Mobile (https://yoob.com).

The realistic renderer follows the FeatherTalk design (Apache-2.0), itself based on
Ultralight-Digital-Human (https://github.com/anliyuan/Ultralight-Digital-Human).

Character model files are not part of this repository. They are licensed separately and
downloaded from the Yoob CDN with credentials issued by Yoob.

This package bundles ONNX Runtime Web 1.27.0 (MIT, Microsoft), with a one-line change that keeps
caller-owned WebGPU buffers alive between runs (scripts/pin-ort-gpu-buffers.mjs).
